{"id":"5d7d7db404fca095","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-complete-development-diamond.md","title":"完整发展的残余菱形","display":"thm-complete-development-diamond — 完整发展的残余菱形","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-complete-development-diamond","aliases":["56-thm-complete-development-diamond"],"display":"thm-complete-development-diamond — 完整发展的残余菱形","depends_on":["[[56-df-complete-development]]","[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]","[[56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance]]","[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]"],"source_section":"§4.5 Proposition 4.5.8","source_printed_pages":"108–109","source_ocr_blocks":[129,130],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-complete-development-diamond"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-complete-development-diamond</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-complete-development-diamond — 完整发展的残余菱形"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b06f8242a0a4824a\" href=\"?note=b06f8242a0a4824a\" title=\"56-df-complete-development\">56-df-complete-development</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06c0295d39a97a66\" href=\"?note=06c0295d39a97a66\" title=\"56-thm-complete-development-unique\">56-thm-complete-development-unique</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59e4d0955d71de93\" href=\"?note=59e4d0955d71de93\" title=\"56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance\">56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.5 Proposition 4.5.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"108–109"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>129</span><span>130</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为正交TRS，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,B\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(U,B\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s\">\\(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CDev}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{CDev}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b06f8242a0a4824a\" href=\"?note=b06f8242a0a4824a\" title=\"56-df-complete-development\">56-df-complete-development</a>；完整发展的存在唯一目标与残余不变性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"06c0295d39a97a66\" href=\"?note=06c0295d39a97a66\" title=\"56-thm-complete-development-unique\">56-thm-complete-development-unique</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59e4d0955d71de93\" href=\"?note=59e4d0955d71de93\" title=\"56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance\">56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance</a>。</li>\n<li>路径拼接和残余的并集/拼接律见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\eta,B)\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\delta,\\varepsilon\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{src}(\\delta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\n\\land\\operatorname{src}(\\varepsilon)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R\\bigl(\\delta,\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,B)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R\\bigl(\\varepsilon,\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta,U)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{tgt}(\\delta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho\\mathbin{;}\\delta,U\\cup B)\n\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\eta\\mathbin{;}\\varepsilon,U\\cup B)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\eta,B)\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\delta,\\varepsilon\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{src}(\\delta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\n\\land\\operatorname{src}(\\varepsilon)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R\\bigl(\\delta,\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,B)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R\\bigl(\\varepsilon,\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta,U)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{tgt}(\\delta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho\\mathbin{;}\\delta,U\\cup B)\n\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\eta\\mathbin{;}\\varepsilon,U\\cup B)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由 FD!，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\\)</span> 对剩余集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,B)\\)</span> 取完整发展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta)\\)</span> 对剩余集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta,U)\\)</span> 取完整发展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>。先前的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 也是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\cup B\">\\(U\\cup B\\)</span> 的发展，因为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 残余包含于相应并集残余。且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,U\\cup B)=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,U\\cup B)=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,B)\\)</span>，\n因为完整性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的残余为空。因此残余拼接律和发展逐步条件保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho;\\delta\">\\(\\rho;\\delta\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\cup B\">\\(U\\cup B\\)</span> 的完整发展；同理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta;\\varepsilon\">\\(\\eta;\\varepsilon\\)</span> 也是。FD! 对同一源项和同一并集给共同终点。FD+ 进一步保证此处剩余集不因原完整发展的内部收缩顺序而变化。</p>\n<p>这与原书证明的带线并集完全对应：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 中给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\cup B\">\\(U\\cup B\\)</span> 的所有头加线，先消除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的线后恰只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B/U\">\\(B/U\\)</span>，再消除这些线到唯一带线正规形；交换两集作法得到同一个正规形。重叠于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\cap B\">\\(U\\cap B\\)</span> 的标记只消一次，因在任一完整发展后它们都没有残余。完整性不要求目标为原TRS正规形。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese (2003), Proposition 4.5.8；已实际读取带线并集证明，并用本地路径/残余拼接律重建。此处写明两条接续路径及其初始残余集，因而可供有指定残余收缩见证的平行移动推导使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-complete-development","status":"re