lse},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"B/U","display":false},{"tex":"U\\cap B","display":false}],"bytes":3213,"backlinks":[{"id":"475d1dab5264244e","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CleanNF}_R(\\Pi)$；$s=S(\\Pi)$，$z=T(\\Pi)$，$P=\\operatorname{TPos}(z)$。$a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$。$\\nu_{SR},A_R,\\operatorname{PWit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-sr-measure]]，提取、Rpc、nonneeded保持见 [[56-lem-needed-reduction-extraction]]、[[56-lem-needed-prefix-rpc]]、[[56-lem-nonneeded-preserves-needed-prefix]]；指定残余图及良基测度见 [[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]、[[56-lem-residual-parallel-moves]]、[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded]]；模式的静态残余传送与无收缩命中时的动态传送见 [[56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport]]。"},{"id":"dbeb02768e341bce","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\Pi,\\Xi\\in\\mathcal P_R$，$T(\\Pi)=S(\\Xi)$；$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(T(\\Xi))$ 且 $\\operatorname{Prefix}_{T(\\Xi)}(P)$，前缀与祖先保持见 [[56-df-position-slices]]、[[56-lem-slice-ancestor]]。$A_R,\\operatorname{NAll}_R,\\operatorname{NNone}_R,\\nu_{SR},\\operatorname{PWit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-sr-measure]]。假设 $\\operatorname{NNone}_R(\\Pi,A_R(\\Xi,P))$ 与 $\\operatorname{NAll}_R(\\Xi,P)$。完整发展菱形见 [[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]，置换及trace不变性见 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]、[[56-lem-trace-permutation]]。"},{"id":"8739f2bb78813039","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统，$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)$。$\\operatorname{wit}_R,\\bullet,\\approx_R,\\preccurlyeq_R$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]、[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]。指定残余的平行移动及完整发展菱形见 [[56-lem-residual-parallel-moves]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]，发展有限性见 [[56-thm-finite-developments]]。"},{"id":"53cadc7f4a7b8337","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 且 $\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s$。路径接口见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]；残余传送及拼接律见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]、[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]。完整发展菱形见 [[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]，不交完整发展与 $\\operatorname{PC}_R$ 见 [[56-lem-disjoint-complete-development]]、[[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]，$\\to_R^*$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]，$\\Rightarrow_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]。$D,z$ 为以下定义的局部对象。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-complete-development-diamond.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b06f8242a0a4824a","06c0295d39a97a66","59e4d0955d71de93","b2ca2cb031a137a3"]}